Harfbuzz

HOW TO UPDATE
* Check out full Android tree.
* Execute `external_updater` but don't upload it since we need updating LICENSE file.
  ```
  tools/external_updater/updater.sh update external/harfbuzz_ng/ --no-upload
  ```
* Generate LICENSE file.
  ```
  cd external/harfbuzz_ng
  python3 generate_notice.py --target . > LICENSE
  ```
  If error message shows up, update list in `generate_notice.py`.
* Amend commit generated by `external_updater` and upload it to gerrit.
  ```
  git commit --amend -a
  repo upload . --cbr
  ```
